Lojban quarterly journal published by ((The Logical Language Group)); 18 issues appeared between July 1986 (as ''Me la Uacintyn Loglytuan'', the Washington D.C. ((Loglan)) journal) and June 1993. Formatted versions are available on ((mw:zo'ei la'e "lu ju'i lobypli li'u"|the lojban mediawiki)). Unformatted versions are available at the Lojban web site: [http://www.lojban.org/files/jl/]